{"arm": "plain", "bug_files": ["toolz/itertoolz.py"], "clean": false, "end": "DONE", "end_text": "The bug was in `toolz/itertoolz.py` in the `unique` function. When a key function is provided, the code was adding the original item to the `seen` set instead of the key value. This caused all items to be considered unique even when they had the same key. The fix was to change `seen_add(item)` to `seen_add(val)` on line 266, so that duplicate items with the same key are correctly removed.", "f2p_passed": 3, "f2p_total": 3, "final_hash": "6cedb648664694e8", "grade_timeout": false, "id": "toolz-1", "kind": "wrong variable", "model": "qwen3.5:2b", "model_s": 42.7, "outcome": "verified", "p2p_broken": 0, "p2p_broken_ids": [], "patch_ok": true, "repo": "toolz", "right_file": true, "settings": "e156e6ca5e598add", "source_changed": ["toolz/itertoolz.py"], "start_hash": "fd990801b8f95008", "tests_changed": [], "tool_s": 1.8, "used": {"calls": 30, "dropped": 0, "prompt_tokens": 115910, "repeats": 0, "tests": 8, "tokens": 3451, "turns": 31}, "wall_s": 44.5}
{"arm": "plain", "bug_files": ["toolz/dicttoolz.py"], "clean": false, "end": "DONE", "end_text": "The bug was in `update_in()` in `toolz/dicttoolz.py`. When a key was missing in the dictionary, the function was not being applied to the `default` value. The fix was to change line 299 from `inner[k] = default` to `inner[k] = func(default)`, so that when a key is missing, the function is applied to the default value as documented.", "f2p_passed": 3, "f2p_total": 3, "final_hash": "b25c960bcff542c0", "grade_timeout": false, "id": "toolz-2", "kind": "missing call", "model": "qwen3.5:2b", "model_s": 29.0, "outcome": "verified", "p2p_broken": 0, "p2p_broken_ids": [], "patch_ok": true, "repo": "toolz", "right_file": true, "settings": "e156e6ca5e598add", "source_changed": ["toolz/dicttoolz.py"], "start_hash": "48d2fadb69cb365b", "tests_changed": [], "tool_s": 0.4, "used": {"calls": 8, "dropped": 0, "prompt_tokens": 26122, "repeats": 0, "tests": 3, "tokens": 2400, "turns": 9}, "wall_s": 29.4}
